hi it's matthew from details and we just  saw the Burberry show and is incredible  there was a bunch of good tracks by the  waterboys every editor loves the  Burberry show because when we got there  we can't wait to see what the music is  gonna be it was a huge return to  heritage all the suiting was beautiful  super slam great silhouettes there's a  lot of Gray's a lot of the trenches have  this blanket stripe at the bottom that's  like a collegiate stripe which was fun  to see that was a new take on a trench  which I love there are a bunch of great  crop puffer jackets and crop coats which  is a really cool way to add a sporty  element to your wardrobe by pairing it  with a suit these studded accessories  were gorgeous there was a lot of  traditional pieces like a portfolio or a  pair of leather gloves that they had it  studs to there was a really sort of  young twist on a classic piece there was  amazing herringbone hats they were kind  of a fun way to wear a hat it was all  super wearable and a lot of it was great  because you can mix it in with what you  have follow me on Twitter at details mat  and check out details calm for more  shows in Milan and Paris throughout the  week
 

